 min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">eCommerce, retail inventory<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Minimum Order Quantity<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">100 units<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Applicable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Applicable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Low minimums, bulk pricing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small business, large-scale brands<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><strong>Production\u00a0 \u00a0Timeline<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">4\u20136 business days, rush orders available<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Applicable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Applicable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Fast turnaround, express production<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Urgent orders, seasonal campaigns<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Free Services<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Design assistance, nationwide shipping<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Applicable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Not Applicable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Free mock-ups, expert guidance<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">All industries, all order sizes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>White Cardboard Boxes for Shipping and Retail Use<\/h2>\n<h3>Strength for Protection and Presentation<\/h3>\n<p>If you&#8217;re packaging items for delivery, our <strong>white cardboard boxes for shipping<\/strong> offer strong walls, secure closures, and protective layering. Whether you&#8217;re shipping glass jars or clothing items, we can adjust the box type and thickness based on product weight and fragility.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Popular use cases include:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Health and skincare products<\/li>\n<li>Fashion accessories and apparel<\/li>\n<li>Small electronics and tech accessories<\/li>\n<li>Subscription boxes or mailer kits<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"989\">Many customers also prefer plain packaging for labeling or stamping manually. For those requirements, you may want to explore our range of <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/blank-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"927\"><strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"863\">Blank Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a>, which are shipped unprinted and ready for multi-purpose use.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1109\">The white exterior works well with branded tapes, stamps, or labels and gives a polished finish to everyday packaging.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Box Type<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Size Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Lid\/Closure Styles<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Best Use Cases<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Customization Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0 Tow-Piece\u00a0 \u00a0Box<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Separate lid and base, sturdy construction, premium feel<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small, Medium, Large, Custom<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Detachable lid, snug fit<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gift packaging, luxury items, jewelry, watches<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom inserts, foil stamping, ribbon accessories<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0 Tuck-End\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Box<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Easy to assemble, flat-packed, efficient for shipping<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small, Medium, Large, Custom<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Top and bottom tuck flaps<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Retail packaging, cosmetics, small electronics<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Full-color printing, die-cut windows, matte finish<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Mailer Box<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Built-in locking tabs, protective walls, self-closing design<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small, Medium, Large, Custom<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Front tuck, side-lock, tab-lock<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">E-commerce shipping, subscription kits, sample boxes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Inside\/outside print, reinforced corners<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>White Box\u00a0 \u00a0with Lid<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Clean white exterior, versatile, suitable for branding or labeling<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small, Medium, Large, Custom<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Hinged, magnetic, or removable lid<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Apparel, skincare, promotional kits, product launches<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Spot UV, embossing, custom inserts<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0 Larger\u00a0 \u00a0White Box<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Extra space, strong walls, stackable, ideal for bulk items or kits<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Large, XL, Custom<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Detachable or hinged lid, reinforced<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Apparel kits, bulk retail, welcome boxes, hampers<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Double-wall, reinforced bottom, custom dividers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><strong>Display\u00a0 \u00a0Box<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Open front or window, designed for shelf appeal and product visibility<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small, Medium, Custom<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Tuck-end, open-top, windowed<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Point-of-sale displays, cosmetics, bakery, accessories<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Die-cut windows, clear PVC, custom shapes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>\u00a0Handled\u00a0 \u00a0Box<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Built-in handle, portable, secure for carrying<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Small, Medium, Custom<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Tuck-in, snap lock, gable top<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gift sets, party favors, jewelry sets, giveaways<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Handle shape, custom print, gloss coating<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h2>Custom Printing and Coating Choices<\/h2>\n<h3>Designed to Match Brand Identity<\/h3>\n<p>From high-end products to daily-use shipping items, we make sure your packaging looks consistent and on-brand.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>One-color or multi-color printing<\/li>\n<li>Minimalist branding with inside printing<\/li>\n<li>QR codes, ingredient panels, or promotional messaging<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re printing bold visuals or subtle accents, our print team ensures your box matches your marketing goals.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Available coating options include:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss finish for a smooth and polished look<\/li>\n<li>Matte finish for non-glare, soft surface<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV for highlighting specific design areas<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These finishes improve the box\u2019s appearance while protecting against smudges and scratches during handling.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>White Cardboard Boxes by Functionality and Industry<\/h2>\n<h3>Reliable Packaging That Does Its Job<\/h3>\n<p>White packaging fits across several industries due to its neutral appearance and structural strength. With options like <strong>white cardboard boxes with lids<\/strong>, businesses can use them for retail displays or internal packaging kits.<\/p>\n<p>Industries that often use these boxes include:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Cosmetics and skincare<\/li>\n<li>Jewelry and small accessories<\/li>\n<li>Clothing and subscription kits<\/li>\n<li>Gift boxes and promotional campaigns<\/li>\n<li>Tech accessories and small devices<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>To see more packaging options grouped by utility, visit our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-functionality\/\"><strong>Cardboard Boxes by Functionality<\/strong><\/a> category. This helps businesses find packaging that suits specific shipping, storage, or retail needs.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Box Size<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Internal Dimensions (inches)<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Recommended Products<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Small<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">4 x 4 x 2<br \/>\n5 x 5 x 3<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Jewelry, Candles, Soap Bars, Gift Cards<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft, White SBS, Recycled Cardboard<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Window cutouts, Thumb notches, Foam or Velvet Inserts<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gift Sets, Retail Display, Sample Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong>Medium<\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">9 x 6 x 3<br \/>\n10 x 8 x 4<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Clothing, Books, Promotional Items, Mugs<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border